{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2021-11-17 10:30:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES BRINGS MORE ENHANCEMENTS TO BUSINESS TRAVELERS AND TRAVEL MANAGERS', 'text': 'DALLAS, NOV. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV) TODAY IS HIGHLIGHTING SEVERAL NEW BENEFITS FOR SOUTHWEST® BUSINESS CUSTOMERS AS THE CARRIER CONTINUES THE JOURNEY OF MAKING IT EASIER TO BOOK, MANAGE, AND SERVICE BUSINESS TRAVEL ON SOUTHWEST AIRLINES®. THE AIRLINE ALSO TODAY REVEALED IT IS BEGINNING WORK ON AN INDUSTRY-LEADING SELF-SERVICE TRAVEL PORTAL DESIGNED TO BRING MORE EFFICIENCIES AND ADD MORE TOOLS TRAVEL MANAGERS, TRAVEL DECISION MAKERS, AND TRAVEL MANAGEMENT COMPANIES NEED TO BETTER MANAGE THEIR RESPECTIVE TRAVEL PROGRAMS WITH SOUTHWEST.'}